    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zelubabeli kūzenga hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a bahangi a ba Hagai na Zakalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ido, būbahangīla a Bayudaya abo baalī ū mu sī ya Yuda nū mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu; būbahangīla mu lina lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli ūyo alī nsugi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Zelubabeli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Salatieli, nū Yeshua ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosadaki, bīmīīla bandya kwīzenga hangī numba ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo īlī mu Yelusalemu, na a bahangi ba ng'wa Mulungu baalī hamò nabo bakūbagunanhaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Tatenai ūyo walī nsugi wa sī ya kū nkīlo gwa mongo, nū Sesabozenai na a bichabo, būbasanga būkandya kūbawīla balīhaya, “Nani ūyo wang'winhile ī shilagīlo sha kwīzenga ī hekalu yenīyī nū kūshimalīja ī shikolo shenīshi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbabūūja na gīkī, “A banhū abo balībeeja ī nzenga yenīyī, banani a mina gabo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu walī abalolile mu welwa ng'holò no a banamhala ba Bayudaya, batabalekije hangī kūshisha ū mhayo gūūshika kūlī Dalio, n'ishosho lyūfunyiwa mu nzīla ya nyalūba, akwīhayaga ī mihayo yenīyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba ya ng'wa Tetanai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo īyī ya mu nyalūba īyo Tetanai nsugi wa sī ya kū nkīlo gwa mongo akandīka, hamò na Shesabozenai na a basugi bichabo a ba kū sī ja kū nkīlo gwa mongo; bakang'wandīkīla ntemi Dalio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būntwalīla būsombooji bo mihayo ūbo walī wandīkilwe, “Kūlī ntemi Dalio, Mhola no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile amane ū ntemi gīkī twalī twajile ū kū sī ya Būyudaya, ū kū hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu ntaale, īlīzengwa na mawe mataale no, hama ū mu ndugu jilīyūtūūlwa mbawa. Nīyo ū nīmo gwenūyū balīgwīta mu būgaliili būtaale no na makono gabo, hama gūlīja wangū wangū no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, a banamhala benabo tūkalūngalūnga nabo tūbabūūja gīkī, ‘Nani ūyo wang'winhile ī shilagīlo sha kwīzenga ī hekalu yenīyī nū kūshimalīja ī shikolo shenīshi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūbabūūja na a mina ga batongeeji babo gīkī tūbandīke tūkwenhele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lishosho īlo bakatwinha līīlī, “A bise tūlī batūmami ba ng'wa Mulungu w'igūlū na sī, hama ī hekalu īyo tūlīyīzenga yenīyī yalī yazengwa ī myaka ī ya kale; ntemi ntaale ūmò waho ū mu Isilaeli walī wīzenga wīmala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī a bakūlūgenji bise bakampelanya ū Mulungu wa ng'wigūlū, ūbatūūla mu nkono go ng'wa Nebukadineza ntemi wa Babuloni, ū Nkalidayo. Ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akīkenaagūla ī hekalu yenīyī, na a banhū ūbasaamya abatwalile Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu ng'waka gwa kwandya gwa ntemi Koleshi wa Babuloni, ū ntemi Koleshi akafunya shilagīlo gīkī, ī numba ya ng'wa Mulungu yenīyī īzengwe hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shiseme sha zahabu nī sha feza, ī sha mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, īsho walī washīnja Nebukadineza kūfuma ū mu hekalu īyo yalī Yelusalemu, ūshisaamīja mu hekalu ya Babuloni, ī shiseme shenīsho ū ntemi Koleshi akashīnja ū mu hekalu ya Babuloni, winhwa munhū ūmò, lina lyakwe Sheshibazali, ūyo walī wang'wīta kūbiza nsugi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ī shiseme shenīshi shisolage ūje nasho ūkashitūūle ū mu hekalu īyo īlī Yelusalemu, nīyo ī numba ya ng'wa Mulungu īzengwe hangī a h'ipandī lyayo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Sheshibazali wiza kwandya kwītūūla ī misingi ya numba ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo īlī Yelusalemu, na lūūlū kwandīja ikanza lyenīlo kūshisha lelo īyī, īkūzengagwa; gwike ītaalī ū kūshila.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ūlū īlībeelela ū mu miso ga ntemi, ni wītagwe būgīsīlīja ū mu numba ja kūbīkīla mihayo ya kale ī ja ng'wikūlū lya Babuloni, ībonwe ūlū gīkī ng'hana ū ntemi Koleshi akafunya shilagīlo sha kwīzenga hangī ī numba ya ng'wa Mulungu yenīyī, ū mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. Tūlīnomba ū ntemi alatwinhe nise ū būlamuji bokwe ū mu mhayo gwenūyū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
